<title>USA: Omnicom Group Names president Wren CEO.</title>
<headline>Omnicom Group Names president Wren CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Omnicom Group Inc said it named its president, John Wren, to the additional title of chief executive, succeeding Bruce Crawford, who will remain chairman.</p>
<p>Wren's new position becomes effective January 1, the company said.  It had been expected since the company named him president in 1995, it added.</p>
<p>Wren is 44.  Crawford, 67, has been Omnicom's chief executive the past eight years, the company said.</p>
